silm:instances_papers_01_orientation_chapters_14_kleisli_enrichment_pipeline_sections_03_cite_as_kleisli_arrow_concrete_anchor_2#witness_record silm:hasLongDescription "The Witness_record is Witness_record = eta_Witness(mittensVetRecord77) is the Free(Sigma)-wrapped result of citing the vet record. It carries the verbatim quote from the source file, the line range, and the local key, all packaged as a typed witness in the Kleisli category Kl(Free(Sigma))." .
